<title>CANADA: BCE says board to recommend stock split.</title>
<headline>BCE says board to recommend stock split.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>BCE Inc said on Monday its board will recommend a two-for-one stock split for shareholder approval at the company's annual meeting on April 30.</p>
<p>&quot;Following significant growth in share price over the last 18 months, BCE's board of directors will recommend for shareholder approval at the company's annual meeting, which will be held in Montreal on April 30, 1997, a two-for-one split of its common shares,&quot; BCE said in a statement.</p>
<p>BCE shares were halted pending news on the Toronto and New York stock exchanges. They were at 65.40 in Toronto, down 0.30, and at 48-5/8, down 1/4 in New York.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
</text>
